#X text 82 4268 cutoff (Cutoff) 0..100 \, CC 37: filter cutoff \; reso (Resonance) 0..30 \, CC 39: filter resonance \; tvfkf (Cutoff KF) 0..14 \, CC 40: cutoff keyfollow step \; tvfenv (TVF env) 0..100 \, CC 41: filter envelope depth \; tvfvelo (TVF velo) 0..100 \, CC 42: filter envelope depth by \;   velocity \; tvfsustain (TVF sustain) 0..100 \, CC 43: filter envelope \;   sustain level \; tvflfodepth (TVF LFO) 0..100 \, CC 44: filter LFO depth \; tvfat (TVF aftert.) -7..7 \, CC 45: cutoff by aftertouch, f 64;
