#X text 82 4470 tvft1 (TVF T1) 0..100 \, CC 46: filter envelope times \; tvft2 (TVF T2) 0..100 \, CC 47: filter envelope times \; tvft3 (TVF T3) 0..100 \, CC 48: filter envelope times \; tvft4 (TVF T4) 0..100 \, CC 49: filter envelope times \; tvft5 (TVF T5) 0..100 \, CC 50: filter envelope times \; tvfl1 (TVF L1) 0..100 \, CC 51: filter envelope levels \; tvfl2 (TVF L2) 0..100 \, CC 52: filter envelope levels \; tvfl3 (TVF L3) 0..100 \, CC 53: filter envelope levels, f 64;
#X obj 60 4612 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty PAGE\ 5\ \ PARTIAL\ TVA\ \ CC\ 54-61 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
