#X obj 60 5000 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty PAGE\ 7\ \ TONE\ \ CC\ 76-83 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 5028 structure (Structure) 1..7 \, CC 76: S+S \, S+S ring \, P+S \, P+S \;   ring \, S+P ring \, P+P \, P+P ring \; pbal (Partial bal) 0..100 \, CC 77: balance of the two partials \; mute (Partials on) 0..3 \, CC 78: partials sounding: none \, \;   first \, second \, both \; pmodlfo (Vibrato) 0..100 \, CC 79: pitch LFO depth \; pmodlever (Vib lever) 0..100 \, CC 80: pitch LFO depth by the \;   lever \; pmodat (Vib aftert.) 0..100 \, CC 81: pitch LFO depth by \;   aftertouch \; penvvelo (P-ENV velo) 0..2 \, CC 82: pitch envelope by velocity \; penvtimekf (P-ENV KF) 0..4 \, CC 83: pitch envelope time \;   keyfollow, f 64;
